Production illustration sheet in exactly the same style as the reference image: four SEPARATE isometric translucent frosted-glass slabs, arranged in a 2x2 grid with wide empty gaps so no slab touches another, each slab centered in its quadrant at the same size and the same isometric angle as the reference slabs. Top-left: pale blue slab carrying a database cylinder, a small grid cube and a navy elephant mascot. Top-right: pale mint-green slab carrying a hexagon JS badge, an isometric L-shaped block logo, dashed circuit lines and two tiny cubes. Bottom-left: pale blue slab carrying a flat dashboard UI with bars, a donut chart and a line chart. Bottom-right: pale violet slab carrying a smartphone lying flat showing an app UI. Thin navy outlines, soft glass, visible slab thickness. Background: one perfectly flat solid color #F1F5F7 everywhere, no checkerboard, no grid, no shadows on the ground, no dashed guide lines, no text, no labels.
